{"id":"brite","lemma":"Brite","pos":"noun","rank":4017,"glosses":["Briton (inhabitant of Great Britain)"],"ipa":"/ˈbʁɪtə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7e/De-Brite.ogg/De-Brite.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Briten","plural":"Briten","feminine":"Britin"},"examples":[{"text":"Er ist Brite.","en":"He is British.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sie erwarteten, dass die Briten gewinnen würden.","en":"They expected the British to win.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"expected, anticipated","l":"erwartet"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to win"},{"g":"dignity","l":"Würde"}]},{"text":"Die Briten erkletterten den Hügel.","en":"The British climbed the hill.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"hill"}]},{"text":"Die Briten zogen sich schließlich zurück.","en":"The British finally retreated.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to pull","l":"ziehen"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"in the end"},{"g":"stand back!"}]},{"text":"Die Japaner essen mehr Rindfleisch als die Briten.","en":"The Japanese eat more beef than the British do.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"Japanese"},{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"beef"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}